Your version had to win the factual half. `master` said *"Sign-out does not help: `useSignOut` never clears the company cache"*, which this PR makes false. What I committed keeps that correction and the "covers the button, not the question" distinction, and drops a restatement of the leak that the paragraph above already makes:

```
// Sign-out is no longer the hole it was: `useSignOut` now resets every
